            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a975"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1226" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1239">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>they were like: "Hi Shiray", and then I was like: "Shyrai, do not look at them! Wo do not speak to them!"  </ANNOTATION_VALUE>
